  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "被困在封印混沌与怪物先知King Mokdu追随者的诅咒棺匣中，每轮都更深陷入记忆、苦难与轮回",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "You are trapped within the Casket — a cursed device forged to imprison the will of chaos and those who follow the monstrous prophet, King Mokdu. Every run drives you deeper into a cycle of memory, suffering, and rebirth, handing you new weapons and corrupted artifacts to engrave and master.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3129360/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "武器觉醒、传奇刻印与可叠加遗物共同塑造每轮构筑",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Weapons — bound to Wardens of Ordeal, they define your combat identity and unlock powerful Awakening and Final Awakening skills. Legendary Artifacts (30) — corrupted relics whose abilities you unlock by spending Echoes to Engrave them, working toward a full Revelation: the central pursuit of every run. Common Artifacts (60+) — stack and duplicate to reinforce and mutate your stats.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3129360/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "普通敌人可被连击压制，但Fiend完全不会硬直，必须读懂攻击节奏并用Counter Spell精准招架制造破绽",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Most stagger under your blows, so you press forward and carve through them — but Fiends never flinch. To break one you must read its rhythm and answer with a Counter Spell, a clean parry that turns its assault into your opening.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3129360/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
